  "description": "Cedric Mondrich and Aurora Roman married for mutual convenience, agreeing to live as nothing more than friends. Aurora thought he would never see her as a woman… or so she believed. After their wedding, she begins to dream of sharing intimate nights with Cedric, leaving her caught between the boundaries of reality and illusion. Are these just dreams, or could they be something more? Once again, she closes her eyes, completely unaware of the truth. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n *Note: Part of Lezhin's Erofan Short Story Collection (에~로판 단편선) or the Steamy Collection in English.*",
